{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（20日）上午7時19分，警方接獲一名女子報案，指其女兒在打鼓嶺蓮麻坑路一村屋內暈倒。</p><p>人員接報到場，發現26歲姓黃女子倒臥在上址一房間的床上，已經陷入昏迷，由救護車送往北區醫院搶救，惜終告不治。據了解，事主有身體疾病紀錄。</p><figure><img alt=\"事主陷入昏迷，由救護車送往北區醫院搶救，其後被證實死亡。（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261016/1187576774913953792926350.jpeg/x48gL4O99UrCYRliltn6q366sWC0Y4VIdKGA_06hgP8\"/><figcaption>事主陷入昏迷，由救護車送往北區醫院搶救，其後被證實死亡。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T12:04:06.789298+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":149,"images":1,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T02:10:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-20T12:18:37.647482+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T11:58:14.217739+00:00","content_hash":"7cf9d32d84f10fa6caf5095fae581dfd0b04784ddb80df75b3b438063b320475","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}